{
  "about": "SPEC-100 CON-009 / TEST-048: one table of frames and the room each has. The hub (cbcl-core-msg:room, eunit cbcl-core-msg-tests) and the client (recipientOf over role-frame.mjs frameRoom, node role-frame.test.mjs) both read it, so the two rules cannot drift apart unseen. room null = no room: the hub refuses the frame.",
